{"id":"942add4e9888c0f5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-valid-proof.md","title":"Valid Proof","display":"df-valid-proof — Valid Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-valid-proof","aliases":["92-df-valid-proof"],"display":"df-valid-proof — Valid Proof","depends_on":["[[92-df-proof]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 30、35（PDF 47、52）","source_status":"本地 G 证明关系别名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-valid-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-valid-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-valid-proof — Valid Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30、35（PDF 47、52）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 G 证明关系别名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(p\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (finite formula sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_G\\)</span> (proof relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Proof}_G(p,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Proof}_G(p,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有效证明：正确证明的定义</li>\n<li>证明序列以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>结尾</li>\n<li>每步正确（公理或规则应用）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G\\)</span> 是语法对象层对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_G\\)</span> 的别名</li>\n<li>它的参数是证明序列和公式，而不是自然数编码；数值上的原始递归关系应写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\)</span></li>\n<li>只有在固定有效编码并证明公理与规则检验有效之后，码层证明关系才可在算术中表示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本定义的两个参数是 G 的语法对象。原书 Pf 是对 # 编码的外部自然数谓词，另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a>；二者的定义域和编号都不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23b675b1348a813e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_G$ (proof relation, see [[92-df-proof]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本定义的两个参数是 G 的语法对象。原书 Pf 是对 # 编码的外部自然数谓词，另见 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]；二者的定义域和编号都不同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Proof}_G(p,\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)","display":false}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-valid-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["23b675b1348a813e","e0eabee5d77258a7","7a63648901cbcd33"]}